/*
 * Copy for the Meta Ads campaign builder (madsb_*) and its preflight check
 * names (mads_check_*).
 *
 * The builder asks the owner a handful of business questions -- what is
 * advertised, the goal, where people go, budget, the ad itself -- and HOMATCH
 * does the technical Meta setup. The copy keeps that split visible.
 *
 * RULES THESE STRINGS FOLLOW.
 *
 * No promised outcome. Meta performs the final ad review and results cannot
 * be guaranteed; every language says exactly that, no softer and no stronger.
 *
 * Money is stated as a ceiling. The total is the maximum charge; only the
 * advertising budget goes to Meta; the service fee stays with HOMATCH.
 *
 * Brand and technical tokens stay as written: HOMATCH, Meta, Facebook,
 * Instagram, Messenger, WhatsApp, Stories, Reels, https://, JPG/PNG/WebP,
 * MP4/MOV, MB, px, USD, GEL and the 1:1 / 4:5 / 9:16 ratios.
 *
 * Order is en, ka, ru, tr, ar, he — LANGS in lib/i18nSplice.mjs.
 */
